   },
   "receiver_party": "yes",
   "note": "Sender duty: Art. 55(1)(c) 'report, without undue delay, to the AI Office'. No receiver duty to acknowledge, publish or forward the report; Art. 55(3) confidentiality (Art. 78) bars publication. Art. 90(2) AI Office informs Board of measures (not coded as a duty to account for handling of reports)."
  },
